>>> suffers. And regardless of what problems your chosen lojbau is, it isn't
>>> perfect. It never will be. Dividing our efforts just makes it so that the
>>> true goal of all these languages- to be /spoken/ by /people/- will never be
>>> accomplished.
>>>
>>> The quest for perfection is a futile one. What we have with Lojban now
