>>>
>>> If we want jbogugde to exist, if we want people to speak our language-
>>> whichever one we decide on- then what we need to do is not to make a new
>>> one whenever we see problems. We need to either find an acceptable solution
>>> /within/ our language, or we need to /deal with it/.
>>>
